## SCOPE NOTE

WebSearch/OpenAlex not used (budget exhausted, per instruction). Everything below came from Europe PMC full-text XML, ar5iv, Crossref, arXiv API, direct PDF fetches, Wayback CDX, and HN Algolia. Two royalsocietypublishing.org URLs returned **HTTP 403** to WebFetch; both papers were recovered in full through Europe PMC instead.

